{"parse": {"title": "小径/再见，来亚什基/被留下的", "pageid": 106680, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小径</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A2.AB.E7.95.99.E4.B8.8B.E7.9A.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"被留下的\">被留下的</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 被留下的</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叶甫根尼的确向来行事简洁干练，他们都曾预想过打开储物柜后的情景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但此刻维拉眼前的这样东西只是一个小铁盒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的双手稍有颤抖，随后——稳当地承托起了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>盒子底下刻着字……是叶甫根尼同志的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>揭开盒盖，展平信纸。教师深吸一口气，认真辨识着眼前的笔迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“不必为我浪费时间。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>读了开头就知道这是他留下的信……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“我抓紧时间写下了一些有关来亚什基未来发展的方案。个人的眼光必定有所局限……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“但它或许能为你们提供一些前进的思路。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“首要的就是资源问题。必须将精力放在资源的维护与开采上，早日进行规划……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“我能想到的资源种类及贸易建议、注意事项，都尽可能一一列举……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“其次是镇上建筑的维护，还有少量日常工作，魔精常出没的地点等……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“另，早些时候曾有一批掺入少量卢恩矿石的零件，有回收利用的价值。盒中是已经找到的几枚。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“纸面有限。详细方案都写在了我的工作日志里，就在房间桌面。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“与芝诺的合作也仍然列入备选。记住，在面对最坏的情况时，首要的是活下去……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“祝一切顺利。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“向每位同志敬礼。叶甫根尼。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……信件就写到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>他还真是贯彻了自己的作风……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>这时候也不说点别的话么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>叶甫根尼同志一向会把信任表现在实际行动中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>又或者他想说的太多，这张纸写不下，时间也不够……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>振作起来，我们去取那本工作日志吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>随后，我会向大家公布信件的内容。是时候开始详细考虑日后的发展规划了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一折，两折，三折。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教师仔细地将信件收起，盖好盒盖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>走吧，克努特同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>行，等忙完了，咱们再去山崖边上跟这家伙说说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>说起来，现在总能搞到点像样的酒了！我得给他捎两瓶……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小径/再见，来亚什基/被留下的"}}